{"seq":3,"slug":"embodied-intelligence","title":"具身智能","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"具身智能-简介\">具身智能 简介</h1><p>具身智能（Embodied Intelligence）是研究如何让智能体通过物理身体与真实世界进行交互、感知与学习的前沿交叉学科。不同于纯粹的数字智能，具身智能强调智能必须&quot;扎根&quot;于物理世界——通过传感器获取信息，通过执行器产生动作，在闭环反馈中不断适应与进化。</p>\n<p>本课程面向具有机器人学、人工智能或控制工程背景的高年级本科生与研究生，要求具备线性代数、概率论、Python 编程以及深度学习基础知识。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>基础与感知</strong>建立具身智能的数学与物理基础，涵盖机器人运动学与动力学建模、多模态传感器融合技术，以及面向具身交互的三维场景理解方法。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>决策与控制</strong>聚焦智能体如何在不确定环境中做出行动决策，包括强化学习在机器人控制中的应用、运动规划与轨迹优化算法，以及从人类示教中学习技能的模仿学习范式。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>具身系统</strong>深入工程实现层面，探讨人形机器人的全身协调控制、仿真到现实的迁移技术（Sim-to-Real），以及面向复杂物体的灵巧操作系统设计。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>前沿与应用</strong>展望该领域最新进展，涵盖大规模基础模型驱动的具身智能、视觉语言导航与目标搜索，以及人机协作和社会服务机器人的发展趋势。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先建立扎实的运动学与感知基础（第1章），再理解决策与控制核心方法（第2章），然后结合具体系统实现深化理解（第3章），最后通过前沿研究拓展视野（第4章）。建议结合仿真平台（如 Isaac Gym、MuJoCo）进行实践练习。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations-and-perception","title":"基础与感知","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"robot-dynamics-kinematics","title":"机器人动力学与运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception/robot-dynamics-kinematics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multimodal-perception","title":"多模态感知融合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception/multimodal-perception"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scene-understanding","title":"场景理解与语义建图","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/foundations-and-perception/scene-understanding"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"decision-and-control","title":"决策与控制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/decision-and-control","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reinforcement-learning-robotics","title":"强化学习与机器人控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/decision-and-control/reinforcement-learning-robotics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"motion-planning","title":"运动规划与轨迹优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/decision-and-control/motion-planning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"imitation-learning","title":"模仿学习与人类示教","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/decision-and-control/imitation-learning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"embodied-systems","title":"具身系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/embodied-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"humanoid-robot-systems","title":"人形机器人系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/embodied-systems/humanoid-robot-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sim-to-real-transfer","title":"仿真到现实迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/embodied-systems/sim-to-real-transfer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"embodied-manipulation","title":"具身操作与灵巧抓取","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/embodied-systems/embodied-manipulation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers-and-applications","title":"前沿与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/frontiers-and-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundation-models-embodied","title":"基础模型与具身智能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/frontiers-and-applications/foundation-models-embodied"},{"seq":2,"slug":"embodied-navigation","title":"具身导航与探索","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/frontiers-and-applications/embodied-navigation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-robot-collaboration","title":"人机协作与社会机器人","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/embodied-intelligence/frontiers-and-applications/human-robot-collaboration"}]}]}